      "requestedChange": "Replace the opening diamond-to-king route with a complete diamond-to-nine development plan, explaining subsequent honor plays and preserving CA until the diamond losers have been conceded. Update the public reason accordingly; D4 itself can remain."
    }
  ],
  "advisorySuggestions": []
}

